{
  "answer_html": "<div class=\"prose dark:prose-invert inline leading-relaxed break-words min-w-0 [word-break:break-word] [&amp;_&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;_&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0\" data-renderer=\"lm\"><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:align-top\">MyyShop is an <strong>AI-driven creator-marketing platform</strong> that helps social-media creators connect with brands and earn money through collaborations. It describes itself as charging creators no platform commission and uses algorithmic matching to surface relevant opportunities.<span class=\"citation-nbsp\"></span><span class=\"citation inline\" data-pplx-citation=\"\" data-pplx-citation-url=\"https://www.myyshop.com/\"><span class=\"group/trigger inline-flex min-w-0\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"citation inline\" style=\"width: 69px;\"><span class=\"relative -mt-px max-w-full min-w-0 whitespace-nowrap -top-px font-sans text-base text-primary select-none selection:bg-super-selection selection:text-primary dark:selection:text-super-primary\"><span class=\"text-3xs rounded-md group min-w-4 max-w-full cursor-pointer align-middle font-mono tabular-nums font-normal transition-colors duration-150 inline-flex items-center gap-0 py-[0.1875rem] leading-snug px-[0.3rem] [@media(hover:hover)]:hover:bg-subtle group-data-[state=open]/trigger:bg-subtle border-subtlest ring-subtlest divide-subtlest bg-soft\"><span class=\"inline-block relative !mt-0 ![vertical-align:unset] max-w-[25ch] overflow-hidden\">myyshop</span><span class=\"inline-block ml-1 mr-px !mt-0 ![vertical-align:unset]\"><span class=\"opacity-50\">+1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h2 class=\"font-semibold leading-tight text-pretty mb-2 mt-4 [[data-has-inline-images]_&amp;]:clear-end text-lg first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\" id=\"what-creators-can-do\">What creators can do</h2><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:align-top\">Depending on the campaign, a creator may be able to:</p><ul class=\"marker:text-secondary list-disc pl-8\"><li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\"><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:align-top\">Make sponsored content for a brand.</p></li><li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\"><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:align-top\">Promote products on social platforms and receive a fixed payment or performance-based earnings.</p></li><li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\"><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:align-top\">Join affiliate campaigns and earn commission on qualifying sales.</p></li><li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\"><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:align-top\">Participate in TikTok-oriented campaigns, including some that compensate eligible creators based on verified video views.<span class=\"citation-nbsp\"></span><span class=\"citation inline\" data-pplx-citation=\"\" data-pplx-citation-url=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/media-advertising/articles/myyshop-launches-paid-every-view-091300863.html\"><span class=\"group/trigger inline-flex min-w-0\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"citation inline\" style=\"width: 121px;\"><span class=\"relative -mt-px max-w-full min-w-0 whitespace-nowrap -top-px font-sans text-base text-primary select-none selection:bg-super-selection selection:text-primary dark:selection:text-super-primary\"><span class=\"text-3xs rounded-md group min-w-4 max-w-full cursor-pointer align-middle font-mono tabular-nums font-normal transition-colors duration-150 inline-flex items-center gap-0 py-[0.1875rem] leading-snug px-[0.3rem] [@media(hover:hover)]:hover:bg-subtle group-data-[state=open]/trigger:bg-subtle border-subtlest ring-subtlest divide-subtlest bg-soft\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 !mt-0 ![vertical-align:unset] mr-1\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"可信域名\" data-testid=\"trusted-citation-check\" class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center\"><svg role=\"img\" class=\"inline-flex fill-current shrink-0 text-secondary\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#pplx-icon-custom-shield-check\"></use></svg></span></span><span class=\"inline-block relative !mt-0 ![vertical-align:unset] max-w-[25ch] overflow-hidden\">finance.yahoo</span><span class=\"inline-block ml-1 mr-px !mt-0 ![vertical-align:unset]\"><span class=\"opacity-50\">+1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:align-top\">For example, a beauty creator might receive a brand brief, publish a product video, and be paid either a set campaign fee, a commission on sales, or—in a CPM/view-based campaign—according to approved video performance.</p><h2 class=\"font-semibold leading-tight text-pretty mb-2 mt-4 [[data-has-inline-images]_&amp;]:clear-end text-lg first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\" id=\"who-is-behind-it\">Who is behind it</h2><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:align-top\">MyyShop says it is backed by <strong>DHgate Group</strong>, the cross-border e-commerce company. It originally launched around 2020 as a SaaS platform for store creation and dropshipping, helping merchants source products, manage fulfillment, and sell through channels such as social media. Its current positioning emphasizes creator-brand collaborations and influencer monetization instead.<span class=\"citation-nbsp\"></span><span class=\"citation inline\" data-pplx-citation=\"\" data-pplx-citation-url=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/media-advertising/articles/myyshop-launches-paid-every-view-091300863.html\"><span class=\"group/trigger inline-flex min-w-0\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"citation inline\" style=\"width: 121px;\"><span class=\"relative -mt-px max-w-full min-w-0 whitespace-nowrap -top-px font-sans text-base text-primary select-none selection:bg-super-selection selection:text-primary dark:selection:text-super-primary\"><span class=\"text-3xs rounded-md group min-w-4 max-w-full cursor-pointer align-middle font-mono tabular-nums font-normal transition-colors duration-150 inline-flex items-center gap-0 py-[0.1875rem] leading-snug px-[0.3rem] [@media(hover:hover)]:hover:bg-subtle group-data-[state=open]/trigger:bg-subtle border-subtlest ring-subtlest divide-subtlest bg-soft\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 !mt-0 ![vertical-align:unset] mr-1\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"可信域名\" data-testid=\"trusted-citation-check\" class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center\"><svg role=\"img\" class=\"inline-flex fill-current shrink-0 text-secondary\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#pplx-icon-custom-shield-check\"></use></svg></span></span><span class=\"inline-block relative !mt-0 ![vertical-align:unset] max-w-[25ch] overflow-hidden\">finance.yahoo</span><span class=\"inline-block ml-1 mr-px !mt-0 ![vertical-align:unset]\"><span class=\"opacity-50\">+1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h2 class=\"font-semibold leading-tight text-pretty mb-2 mt-4 [[data-has-inline-images]_&amp;]:clear-end text-lg first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\" id=\"things-to-keep-in-mind\">Things to keep in mind</h2><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:align-top\">MyyShop is a platform for accessing opportunities, not a guarantee of income. Carefully check each campaign’s deliverables, usage rights, payment terms, required disclosure, eligibility rules, and how/when performance is verified before creating or posting content. Public app reviews include both positive and negative experiences, so it is sensible to document agreements and keep records of submitted work and communications.<span class=\"citation-nbsp\"></span><span class=\"citation inline\" data-pplx-citation=\"\" data-pplx-citation-url=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/myyshop/id6449818392\"><span class=\"inline-flex\" aria-label=\"MyyShop - App Store - Apple\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"citation inline\"><a rel=\"noopener\" class=\"inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/myyshop/id6449818392\"><span class=\"relative -mt-px max-w-full min-w-0 whitespace-nowrap -top-px font-sans text-base text-primary select-none selection:bg-super-selection selection:text-primary dark:selection:text-super-primary\"><span class=\"text-3xs rounded-md group min-w-4 max-w-full cursor-pointer align-middle font-mono tabular-nums font-normal transition-colors duration-150 inline-flex items-center gap-0 py-[0.1875rem] leading-snug px-[0.3rem] [@media(hover:hover)]:hover:bg-subtle group-data-[state=open]/trigger:bg-subtle border-subtlest ring-subtlest divide-subtlest bg-soft\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 !mt-0 ![vertical-align:unset] mr-1\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"可信域名\" data-testid=\"trusted-citation-check\" class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center\"><svg role=\"img\" class=\"inline-flex fill-current shrink-0 text-secondary\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#pplx-icon-custom-shield-check\"></use></svg></span></span><span class=\"inline-block relative !mt-0 ![vertical-align:unset] max-w-[25ch] overflow-hidden\">apple</span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p></div>",
  "answer_text": "MyyShop is an AI-driven creator-marketing platform that helps social-media creators connect with brands and earn money through collaborations. It describes itself as charging creators no platform commission and uses algorithmic matching to surface relevant opportunities.\nmyyshop\n+1\n\nWhat creators can do\n\nDepending on the campaign, a creator may be able to:\n\nMake sponsored content for a brand.\n\nPromote products on social platforms and receive a fixed payment or performance-based earnings.\n\nJoin affiliate campaigns and earn commission on qualifying sales.\n\nParticipate in TikTok-oriented campaigns, including some that compensate eligible creators based on verified video views.\nfinance.yahoo\n+1\n\nFor example, a beauty creator might receive a brand brief, publish a product video, and be paid either a set campaign fee, a commission on sales, or—in a CPM/view-based campaign—according to approved video performance.\n\nWho is behind it\n\nMyyShop says it is backed by DHgate Group, the cross-border e-commerce company. It originally launched around 2020 as a SaaS platform for store creation and dropshipping, helping merchants source products, manage fulfillment, and sell through channels such as social media. Its current positioning emphasizes creator-brand collaborations and influencer monetization instead.\nfinance.yahoo\n+1\n\nThings to keep in mind\n\nMyyShop is a platform for accessing opportunities, not a guarantee of income. Carefully check each campaign’s deliverables, usage rights, payment terms, required disclosure, eligibility rules, and how/when performance is verified before creating or posting content. Public app reviews include both positive and negative experiences, so it is sensible to document agreements and keep records of submitted work and communications.\napple",
